  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p>Artsy Chic Accessories, Pillows, Wall Art, Books, Cards, Icon Dolls &amp; more! Original artwork created by KahriAnne Kerr and turned into cute accessories, home decor and more.</p><p>Growing up on a farm outside of Tripoli in northeast Iowa, where fashion is of little concern, KahriAnne Kerr broke the mold. KahriAnne taught herself how to sew and design, started her own clothing business at age 19, and moved to NYC at 20 years old to attend the Fashion Institute of Technology. The KAHRI collection has evolved over the years and now includes a range of edgy yet feminine artsy accessories, cosmetic bags, handbags, clothing, home décor, fashion art, and fashion icon dolls.</p></div>",
